caption: Godsoul and Divine Ranks

Godsoul (Unusual Background, 50 points): You are a god. You can earn experience through the experience gain rules, below, and create souls using the rules in that section. You can forge a heaven, hear prayers, and get to decide what happens to the souls that would go to you when they die. You also qualify to buy other advantages that relate to the nature of your worship, equivalent to a 5 point power talent in scope. You can purchase that power talent and any advantages based on it, and those advantages can benefit from up to five Pacts that relate to your nature as a god. Note that non-beings can gain experience through Worship, and eventually become Gods through earning enough to buy this advantage, then other traits. This is how many gods are born.

Greater God (500, 5 thousand, 50 thousand, and 500 thousand points): This increases the character’s effective God level, opening up new powers and allowing them to affect greater areas and support more potent prophets. Level 6 requires that they be a Cosmic Force or an Infinitely Powerful Being, and costs 5 million points, not that that matters at that level.

Least God: Just Godsoul.

Lesser God: Add the ability to support Divine classes. Designate one college as a Domain.

Middling God: Can support Chosen. Second domain.

Greater God: Can support Heroes. Third Domain. (Exalted Celestial Incarnae)
